The TDCI is inviting to the side-event “Shared Data, Shared Action: Building Trust through Open Transport Data” on 08th October, 2026, as part of the 9th edition of Transport and Climate Change Week.

Transport and Climate Change Week is GIZ's annual flagship event on decarbonising transport, and serves as a hub for regional and international exchanges, featuring partner-hosted side events, fostering peer learning, and incorporating insights from experts. This year's conference will be virtual. Save the date!
